[metadata]
Name:P23 - Life from the Loam is cast when it can take every land in the graveyard (round 1052)
Description:Upstream's FlatMC guard (#12905, in the 11.18 merge of round 1049) asks ActivationGuard.spellProblem about the spell the AI chose, with its targets set. For an "up to N" spell it asked TargetRestrictions.hasCandidates, which skips the targets already chosen, so once the AI had picked every land in its graveyard (3 or fewer) it saw "no candidates" and vetoed the cast (reason=no-valid-targets, at=guard). Flat MC (lite and max) never cast Life from the Loam; the heuristic did. Round 1052: a chosen target that is still legal counts. Expect: the Loam is cast. Three lands in the graveyard, a quiet board.
Turns:1
Expect:aiplayed has Life from the Loam
Expect:failedplays<=0
